      (srcFormula formula)
  · exact paperVariableArityIntegerRadius_pos encodingLength formula
  · exact physicalFormulaSystem_consistent_of_satisfiable
      encodingLength formula satisfiable
  · exact solution
  · exact binary
  · exact weight
